{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"d5e12bdcc0317e81f546483767c6b4f7855fffa895075787ad144db96132a2d6","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review kernel: Pass-2 grounding hardening and finding hygiene","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/verify.py","src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/decide.py","plan_review/workflow_ops.py","plan_review/det_floor.py","orchestrator.py","claims_absence","absence_confirmed_in_context","operator_attested","ac_unverifiable","impact_plan","ADR-0043","ADR-0008","det_blocking_findings","det_advisory_findings","partition_findings","norm ne7642adbf79"],"problem_keywords":["absence-claim grounding","false-premise finding","pass-2 verification","DET finding hygiene","operator-attested AC","in-session-unverifiability","deterministic veto"],"propositions":["Pass-2 findings asserting absence of plan provisions can survive with high validity despite being contradicted by explicit text the same verdict quoted; a FALSE absence premise must be grounded against the plan context and vetoed deterministically.","DET-tier findings can be emitted without concrete subject identifiers (locations, ticket names, or file paths), making them unadjudicable; a hygiene backstop must drop subject-less DET findings at the emission/aggregation point.","Plan-review acceptance criteria tagged [operator-attested] per ADR-0043 are currently treated as unverifiable without in-session proving commands, even though the completion gate accepts them by recorded attestation; the in-session-unverifiability finding must be deterministically suppressed when the attestation flag is present.","The verification contract lacks abstain-safe binaries to classify absence claims and confirm them against plan context, causing false-absence findings to pass into Pass-3 with high confidence.","The E2/F1/E6 rubrics lack ADR-0043 vocabulary, and the coach lacks a move to state concrete attestation evidence for tagged ACs, leaving no guidance on how operator attestation discharges acceptance criteria."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785822492424959924,"uuid":"0acc22fa-9b38-4b93-8d1b-5aee99e01749"}